Third-party runtime dependencies (not shipped in this repo)
-----------------------------------------------------------

The `/brownfield` skill at runtime resolves personas and helpers from the
**Grok Build bundled skills tree**, typically installed at:

  ~/.grok/bundled/skills/

Required bundled paths include:

  implement/SKILL.md
  implement/scripts/memory.py
  shared/personas/{design-doc-writer,design-doc-reviewer,implementer,reviewer,security-auditor}.md

Those files are maintained and licensed by xAI / Grok Build, not by this
repository. This project's MIT license covers only the files committed here
(SKILL.md orchestration spec, verify scripts, docs, and CI fixtures).

CI fixture
----------

`fixtures/bundled-skills/` contains minimal stubs so verify scripts can run
without a full Grok install. Stubs are MIT-licensed portions of this repo and
are **not** substitutes for production bundled skills.